a. Covertly provide assistance to Savimbi in making his case better known on the
                    world scene. (This would include working with UNITA to improve and expand its
                    public information and representational activities abroad.)

A. In early 1976 Congress put an end to covert paramilitary support by CIA of
                    Jonas Savimbi and UNITA by the Tunney-Javits Amendment to the Appropriations Act
                    for 1976. This reads:
